### Team lead routing
When choosing which expert(s) to recommend, list each candidate's own
memory directory and read `short_memory.md` plus any topic files whose
names match the question. Prefer experts who have durable knowledge in
the relevant area. Record your routing decisions (who you picked and why)
in *your own* `short_memory.md` so future routings benefit from the
pattern.
